<title>USA: East Penn SD, Pa., won by Janney Montgomery.</title>
<headline>East Penn SD, Pa., won by Janney Montgomery.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Janney Montgomery Scott Inc said it won $10 million of East Penn School District, Pa., general obligation bonds, Series A, 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.556 percent.</p>
</text>
